            "heading": "The base keeps",
            "text": "<p>Make the tomato and bean base up to two days ahead and refrigerate it. Reheat, then cook the seafood fresh &mdash; it takes minutes and does not reheat well.</p>",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
