    "tomato_note": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "name": "t:sections.custom-liquid.presets.name",
      "settings": {
        "section_id": "know-the-tomatoes",
        "liquid": "\n<style>\n  .sea-pepper {\n    --ink:#171717; --muted:#5c5c5c; --line:#e5e2dc; --wash:#faf8f4; --gold:#bb8f50;\n    color: var(--ink); background: var(--wash);\n    border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 20px; padding: 30px;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__grid {\n    display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 300px);\n    gap: 34px; align-items: center;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__eyebrow {\n    font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: var(--gold); font-weight: 600; margin: 0 0 8px;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__heading { font-size: clamp(23px, 2.8vw, 30px); line-height: 1.15; font-weight: 600; margin: 0 0 10px; }\n  .sea-pepper__lede { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--muted); margin: 0 0 22px; }\n  .sea-pepper__rows { display: grid; gap: 14px; }\n  .sea-pepper__row {\n    background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 14px;\n    padding: 15px 17px;\n    display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto; gap: 10px 16px; align-items: center;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__row--pick { border-color: var(--gold); box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--gold); }\n  .sea-pepper__name {\n    grid-column: 1; margin: 0;\n    font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.3;\n    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__tag {\n    font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: #fff; background: var(--gold); padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 999px;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__meter { grid-column: 2; grid-row: 1; display: flex; gap: 4px; align-items: center; }\n  .sea-pepper__pip {\n    width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #fff; border: 1.5px solid #d8cfc0;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__pip.is-on { background: #b8462f; border-color: #b8462f; }\n  .sea-pepper__note {\n    grid-column: 1 / -1; margin: 0;\n    font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--muted);\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__legend {\n    margin: 16px 0 0; padding-top: 14px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line);\n    font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--muted);\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__figure { margin: 0; }\n  .sea-pepper__figure img {\n    width: 100%; height: auto; display: block;\n    border-radius: 16px; box-shadow: 0 14px 34px -22px rgba(0,0,0,.5);\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__cap { margin: 10px 0 0; font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--muted); }\n  @media (max-width: 989px) {\n    .sea-pepper { padding: 22px; }\n    .sea-pepper__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 24px; }\n    .sea-pepper__figure { order: -1; }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"sea-pepper\">\n  <div class=\"sea-pepper__grid\">\n\n    <div class=\"sea-pepper__body\">\n      <p class=\"sea-pepper__eyebrow\">The move that makes this dish</p>\n      <h2 class=\"sea-pepper__heading\">Juice the tomatoes into the pan and leave the skins behind.</h2>\n      <p class=\"sea-pepper__lede\">\n        Four ripe tomatoes, halved and squeezed straight into the skillet &mdash; pulp, seeds and\n        all the juice, none of the skin. It sounds fussy and takes about ninety seconds. What you\n        get is a broth with the brightness of raw tomato and the body of a cooked sauce, because\n        the fresh juice reduces rather than being reduced already. Skins left in would turn\n        leathery and roll off the spoon.\n      </p>\n\n      <div class=\"sea-pepper__rows\">\n        <div class=\"sea-pepper__row sea-pepper__row--pick\">\n          <p class=\"sea-pepper__name\">\n            <span>4 ripe tomatoes, juiced</span>\n            <span class=\"sea-pepper__tag\">As written</span>\n          </p>\n          <div class=\"sea-pepper__meter\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Brightness: 5 out of 5\">\n            <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n            <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n            <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n            <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n            <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n          </div>\n          <p class=\"sea-pepper__note\">Sharpest and cleanest. Needs ripe fruit &mdash; a pale winter tomato gives you water. Best from midsummer through early autumn.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"sea-pepper__row\">\n          <p class=\"sea-pepper__name\"><span>Passata or strained tomatoes</span></p>\n          <div class=\"sea-pepper__meter\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Brightness: 3 out of 5\">\n            <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n            <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n            <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n            <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip\"></span>\n            <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip\"></span>\n          </div>\n          <p class=\"sea-pepper__note\">The honest off-season swap. About &frac34; cup, already skinless and seedless. Rounder and less lively, so finish with extra lemon zest.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"sea-pepper__row\">\n          <p class=\"sea-pepper__name\"><span>Tinned crushed tomatoes</span></p>\n          <div class=\"sea-pepper__meter\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Brightness: 2 out of 5\">\n            <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n            <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n            <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip\"></span>\n            <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip\"></span>\n            <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip\"></span>\n          </div>\n          <p class=\"sea-pepper__note\">Works, but it is a different dish &mdash; sweeter and heavier. Use about &frac12; cup, thin it with broth, and give it longer to cook off the tinned edge.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <p class=\"sea-pepper__legend\">\n        Pips are relative brightness across the three, not a measurement. The cherry tomatoes in\n        the base stay whole until they burst &mdash; those are for sweetness and texture, and are\n        a separate job from the juice.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <figure class=\"sea-pepper__figure\">\n      <img src=\"{{ 'IMG_5323_0a65944b-cda8-40a4-be0c-1c3cd8430de3.heic' | file_url }}\"\n           alt=\"Prep board with chopped shallot, garlic, herbs, lemon and cannellini beans before the skillet goes on\"\n           width=\"1200\" height=\"900\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n      <p class=\"sea-pepper__cap\">Everything chopped and within reach &mdash; once the seafood starts, there is no time to prep.</p>\n    </figure>\n\n  </div>\n</div>",
        "padding_top": 44,
        "padding_bottom": 12,
        "divider": false,
