            "subheading": "Step 4",
            "heading": "Poach the shrimp in the base",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "text": "<p>Nestle the shrimp into the tomato and bean mixture and cook, turning once, until they are opaque and just curled. Off the heat the moment they are through &mdash; they will keep cooking in the pan and go rubbery if you let them.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style": "primary",
            "button_external": false,
            "button_icon": true,
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
