            "subheading": "Step 6",
            "heading": "Break the fish in, roe on top, bread alongside",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "text": "<p>Set the fish into the warm base and let residual heat finish it. Break it into large pieces so tender flesh and crisp skin run through the pan. Parsley, spoonfuls of salmon roe, and crusty bread and butter for the broth at the bottom.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
