        "m_text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Everything up to the kale keeps for two days in the refrigerator and arguably improves &mdash; the sun-dried tomato and rosemary settle into the beans overnight. Reheat it gently, stir the kale through, then cook the seafood fresh.</p><p>Do not cook the shrimp or the fish ahead. Both are minutes of work and neither survives reheating; shrimp turn rubbery and crisp skin never comes back.</p>",
